<view class="tech-page"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-title">服务价目</view><view class="tech-subtitle">查看有效项目、收费条款与参考区间</view></view><view class="tech-avatar"><van-icon name="balance-list-o" size="28px" /></view></view><scroll-view scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="tech-chips"><view wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="key" class="tech-chip {{appliance===item.key?'tech-chip--active':''}}" data-filter="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onFilter">{{item.text}}</view></view></scroll-view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="价目暂不可用" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="tech-card catalog-card"><view class="catalog-head" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onExpand"><view><view class="catalog-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tech-caption">{{item.description||'查看价格条款与计费单位'}}</view></view><van-icon name="{{item.expanded?'arrow-up':'arrow-down'}}" size="14px" /></view><block wx:if="{{item.expanded}}"><view wx:if="{{item.loading}}" class="tech-muted catalog-loading">正在读取条款…</view><view wx:elif="{{item.error}}" class="tech-form-error" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onExpand">{{item.error}}，轻触重试</view><block wx:else><view wx:for="{{item.rules}}" wx:for-item="rule" wx:key="id" class="catalog-rule"><view class="catalog-price"><text>{{rule.feeText}}</text><text>{{rule.priceText}} <text class="catalog-unit">/ {{rule.unit}}</text></text></view><view class="catalog-rule__title">{{rule.title}}</view><view class="tech-caption">{{rule.clauseNo}} · {{rule.ruleVersion}}</view><view wx:if="{{rule.description}}" class="catalog-rule__description">{{rule.description}}</view><view wx:if="{{rule.refundPolicy}}" class="catalog-rule__description">条款说明：{{rule.refundPolicy}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!item.rules.length}}" class="catalog-loading tech-muted">暂无生效价格条款</view></block></block></view><tech-state wx:if="{{!items.length}}" title="暂无有效服务项目" description="平台维护有效项目后，会显示在这里。" /><view class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="info-o" /><text>这里是当前生效的价格规则。具体工单以实际报价及客户确认范围为准，超区间需独立审批。</text></view></block></view>
